{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0683_1000_journalist", "source_sha256": "0515ff62acdfc9d359131e577a16b896df6d4ab8aacd94580d308b56e178b2b5", "ja": "なるほど。今回の合同イベント成功の裏には、\nそういったエピソードがあったんですね。", "zh": "原来如此。这次联合活动能够成功，背后还有这样的经历啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0683_1001_017kth", "source_sha256": "c667f645209d0aaa63eae8a5e1b124400f36851413450f097d863bbff12dc86f", "ja": "はい。ですから、私がリーダーとして\nみんなを引っ張っていたわけじゃなく……。", "zh": "是的。所以，并不是我作为队长带领着大家……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0683_1002_017kth", "source_sha256": "f8a061702df64b69dd2e0de1bb73a5101ca94078454b30c1451ae7efd666a2dd", "ja": "みんなが私をリーダーにしてくれていた。\n……という感じだったと思います。", "zh": "倒不如说是大家让我成为了队长。\n……我觉得是这种感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0683_1003_journalist", "source_sha256": "f21c1199cfb2e4a2c53dc080f89a6588553ce7c53ce9a9047387ed5fb76d7cd5", "ja": "はは、そう捉えるからこそ、琴葉さんがリーダーだった\nのかもしれませんね。さて、次の質問ですが……。", "zh": "哈哈，正因为你是这么理解的，琴叶小姐或许才会成为队长吧。那么，接下来是下一个问题……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0683_1004_017kth", "source_sha256": "ec95031542ecdc7566a97aa9e7517b2cdd9ddb5e91ac15488c350125d31eeade", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさまです。\nインタビュー、あんな感じで大丈夫でしたか？", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了。\n采访刚才那样没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0683_1005_p", "source_sha256": "ca16e79ca9e0c427a57f0f6963a635ffac25b5a671516c27d01d58c475c696db", "ja": "ああ、バッチリだ。詩花のことも話してくれたから、\n黒井社長も文句ないと思う！", "zh": "啊，棒极了。你还提到了诗花的事，\n黑井社长应该也没什么好抱怨的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0683_1006_017kth", "source_sha256": "cb3d122fde6db5c4d6a6c2c15b6958cb62859ad08e57385b2c3af7fd78e9aa5f", "ja": "ふふっ、詩花ちゃんのおかげで、パフォーマンスが\nすごく向上したのは本当のことですから。", "zh": "呵呵，托诗花的福，表演水平确实有了很大提升。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0683_1007_017kth", "source_sha256": "9cd4ca6fbbcfe67bc73a1a97d17a019f7d57f5b0e8b60d36265d9c2b64b6252f", "ja": "ただ、私は少し気になったことがありました。\n……あの、{$P$}？", "zh": "不过，我只是有件事有点在意。\n……那个，{$P$}？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0683_1008_p", "source_sha256": "7c59608752f267d6180b140d18e7d63d6eab88ec8f53b1bf3132cb2afda45b46", "ja": "うん？", "zh": "嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0683_1009_017kth", "source_sha256": "cfef19cbbcf1008d3598fea8f76645d8a8b9aa1575d3e72fee9d230a3a6e5234", "ja": "「私がリーダーに選ばれた理由」って、\nなにか特別なこと、あるんでしょうか？", "zh": "「我被选为队长的理由」，\n是有什么特别的原因在里面吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0683_1010_017kth", "source_sha256": "fc93bed20d5362b334744d522ce81c30fa40615591a1d13511da3c706239cf60", "ja": "私はただ、最年長だからと思ってたんですけど……。\n今日の記者さんは、別の理由と思ったみたいで。", "zh": "我只是以为，因为我是年纪最大的……不过，今天那位记者好像觉得还有别的原因。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0683_1011_p", "source_sha256": "090facf388de0f66aa9fc65008d836575040577cdeedac6b6b072e48b9a6275b", "ja": "ああ、もちろん理由はあるよ。でも『最年長』って\n言葉に、全部含まれてるとも思うな。", "zh": "啊，当然是有理由的。不过我觉得，“年纪最大”这个词本身就已经包含了一切。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0683_1012_017kth", "source_sha256": "ecdde4131a6841a3a4069a473743fcd4b611e189ab7705206eb882de8a0d33c6", "ja": "つまり……責任感とか、真面目なこととか？\nでも、あの記者さんは違うような……？", "zh": "也就是说……责任感啦、认真之类的？\n不过，那位记者好像不是因为这些吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0683_1013_p", "source_sha256": "9afd7ef5143d4339e74dc15946d9fb64e2523230b99344921b8b0818dc2bec07", "ja": "あの記者さんが感じたのは、たぶん\n『みんなをよく見てるところ』とかじゃないかな？", "zh": "那位记者感受到的，应该是『很关注大家』之类的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0683_1014_017kth", "source_sha256": "95c1d2974854ceb58c7d6dc449924de1d0c41811b1758469871ac911a4ae3c92", "ja": "みんなを……。\nでも、見てるだけじゃ何も変えられないですよね？", "zh": "大家……\n可是，光是看着的话，什么也改变不了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0683_1015_p", "source_sha256": "c6ad671bf15bf55637f0b6c28e6cbb9eab22b17c2b8098c4855959594e589d99", "ja": "うん、でも見てないともっと何もできないから。\nリーダーの第一歩は、しっかりみんなを見ることだよ。", "zh": "嗯，不过不看着大家，就更什么都做不了了。\n作为队长，第一步就是好好观察大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0683_1016_p", "source_sha256": "b1e659636c62b70178df84e83b0df2b59c85f045efa63f8f075918d774b7c0e8", "ja": "だからこそ「自分はかわいいって鏡に唱えるイメトレ」\nも、練習に取り入れたんだろ？", "zh": "正因为这样，你才把“对着镜子反复念叨自己很可爱”的想象训练也加入练习了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0683_1017_017kth", "source_sha256": "9db6e0d96f229d175a41638d73a8067121c1ca782cab20acb8c10b87f215db4b", "ja": "そういえば……。えっ？　もしかして、\n{$P$}……見てたんですか！？", "zh": "这么说来……咦？难道说，{$P$}……您都看到了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0683_1018_p", "source_sha256": "929e68ca564ce229dc59c394a90db73db83aa8e95de9ccc7ffc90df5ed86075d", "ja": "そりゃ見るよ。ほら、プロデューサーの仕事も\n見ることから始まるわけだから。", "zh": "当然要看啊。你看，制作人的工作也是从观察开始的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0683_1019_017kth", "source_sha256": "16352e590234a72fda83e3250261acd0e9bd6e8d70d35e669afcc1176bfd25f2", "ja": "あ、そうですね。じゃあしょうがないか……。\nしょうがなくないです！", "zh": "啊，说得也是。那就没办法了……。\n才不是没办法呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0683_1020_p", "source_sha256": "0713fc5cea03df51d08a70ab5288b2fbb6f81f65f26e67766996726a1dd13b3e", "ja": "えっ？　でも自分が可愛いって、\n少しは思えるようになったんじゃ……？", "zh": "咦？不过，你不是已经稍微觉得自己挺可爱了吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0683_1021_017kth", "source_sha256": "b45d2e4506ffab61abd291deccbf4992e06c4df4293e10803ade96184bea7e68", "ja": "そうですけど！　だからって私、別にあれから\n毎日鏡に向かってるとか、そこまでじゃないですから！", "zh": "是没错！但我也没有因此每天对着镜子练习，没到那个程度啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0683_1022_p", "source_sha256": "7c7bd69c3d017789739021051ecf89f6d250b11bd76aadb180f41f9bc2bf6af5", "ja": "ん？　もしかして毎日鏡に向かってるんじゃ……？\n偉いぞ琴葉！　その調子だ！", "zh": "嗯？难道你每天都在对着镜子练习……？\n真棒，琴叶！就保持这个劲头！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0683_1023_017kth", "source_sha256": "544c4fb430e26d7f54a63df2dd90d476b63e42b921636e00f76af01eb106ba2a", "ja": "～～～っっっ！！！", "zh": "～～～！！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
